      "created_at": "2012-04-06T15:08:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just recently picked up the PDF version of the new Marvel RPG done by Margaret Weis. (<a href=\"http://www.margaretweis.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.margaretweis.com/</a>)</p>\n<p>Pretty interesting ruleset.  Now I just need to try it out and see how it plays.  Not for min/maxxers by any means, but for an actual story driven RPG it should be good.</p>\n<p>Who knows, maybe I’ll try converting SOTM characters <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Anyone else pick it up?</p>",
